{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/cavaliers-of-mars-and-pugmire/1514317-question-on-homebrew","id":1514317,"title":"Question on homebrew","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Partner Worlds","Realms of Pugmire"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-06-09T10:16:16-07:00","id":1514317,"title":"Question on homebrew","content":"Can there be homebrew that isn't Canis Minor?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28032-max-waspace","name":"Max Waspace","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar28032_1.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-09T11:51:55-07:00","id":1514323,"title":"","content":"Canis Minor is only for publishing homebrew as third party content.<br /> <br /> Any homebrew that stays &quot;home&quot; is completely legit. You don't have to put your custom monster blocks on Canis Minor to use them in your personal games.<br /> <br /> Any homebrew that's publicly posted in a fashion that doesn't run afoul of IP law is fine too. Like, if you want to discuss homebrew you're working on here to bounce ideas off of people? Also completely legit; you might even get feedback from Eddy if he's not too busy with stuff. If you just want to share a custom magical item your group came up with on your personal Instagram or something? No problem with that.<br /> <br /> Just follow the basic etiquette of fair use and you should be fine: don't post your homebrew in a fashion you'd make money off (that's what Canis Minor is explicitly for), give credit to other people's work when you use it, don't include large swaths of text from the original (basically, people should need the core book to use what you're posting), and don't use homebrew as a Trojan horse to put out a bunch of offensive content by tying it to someone else's work.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-12T01:31:47-07:00","id":1514661,"title":"","content":"Heavy Arms beat me to it! I don't mind people posting text of a cool thing they made to show it off, or whatever. Once someone puts up a PDF that looks like it could be official, however, I'd really prefer it go through Canis Minor, even if people aren't selling it. Thanks!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/15-eddyfate","name":"eddyfate","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar15_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"155"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}